cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. Please also cite the FlyWire / FAFB data and the cell-type annotations it builds on."
title: "flybrain: ML on the Drosophila connectome"
abstract: >-
  Graph neural networks on the FlyWire (FAFB v783) whole-brain connectome of
  Drosophila. A GNN that sees only anonymous wiring structure predicts super
  classes and 434 cell types, compared with baselines that use the labels of
  synaptic partners, including a test on an unlabeled brain hemisphere.
authors:
  - family-names: Vogt
    given-names: Maximilian
repository-code: "https://github.com/Paradoxsmile/flybrain"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - connectomics
  - Drosophila
  - FlyWire
  - graph neural networks
  - cell types
